// Constant character data — anything that never changes in play. Save files
// don't include this file.
//
// This file holds the **dead characters only**. Their identity (name, house,
// gender, skills), birth date, and death date all live here as constants:
// once dead, none of it mutates, so it has no business in the state overlay.
//
// Alive characters live in start.state.ron — they're entirely state because
// the sim rewrites parts of them (gold, levy, death date) during play.
//
// Family ties (parent↔child, husband↔wife) live in families.ron.
//
// Each character carries a `skills` block (martial / prowess / treasury /
// prudence / intrigue / faith), all 0..=20. The values here are the authored
// baseline.
//
// Distribution target (mod-wide): mean ~10, std-dev ~4, with 19-20 reserved
// for legendary rulers and 2-4 for the clearly weak. The range 0..=20 lets
// the AI monthly formulas have headroom — see docs/skills.md (TODO).
